Platform-Specific Dependencies (In-Development Boards)
-------------------------------------------------------

The following dependencies apply only when building for in-development
community boards. They are NOT required for the production build matrix
(pico, esp32, esp32s3, teensy40, teensy41).

- ESP8266: ESP8266 Arduino Core (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
- STM32 Blue Pill: STM32Cube HAL (BSD-3-Clause)
- Arduino Mega 2560: Arduino AVR Core (LGPL-2.1-or-later)

Production Platform Licenses
