- Teensy 4.0/4.1: Teensyduino (LGPL-2.1-or-later)

Binary Distribution Notice
--------------------------

Firmware binaries built with the Arduino or Teensyduino backends may statically
link the Arduino core and/or other LGPL-2.1-or-later components. If you
distribute a compiled firmware binary (.uf2, .hex, .elf, etc.) that includes
such components, the LGPL requires you to provide, or offer to provide, the
corresponding source code and library source code to recipients. This does not
affect distribution of the Ferqon Firmware source code, which is licensed under
